@* Index/home page*@
@* There is the title, images, and paragraphs about my disc golf hobby*@

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Inside the Circle</h1>
    <p class="lead">Disc golf experience, competition, and coaching</p>
</div>

<hr />

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <img src="~/images/competition.jpeg"
             class="img-fluid rounded mb-3"
             alt="Collegiate disc golf competition" />
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
        <img src="~/images/throw.png"
             class="img-fluid rounded mb-3"
             alt="Disc golf drive throw" 
             style="max-height: 350px; width: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4">
        <img src="~/images/putting.jpeg"
             class="img-fluid rounded mb-3"
             alt="Disc golf basket and putting practice" />
    </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-4">
    <p>
        Disc golf has been a huge part of my life, from casual rounds with friends
        to competing at the collegiate level. The sport blends athleticism, strategy,
        and mental focus, making every course and every throw a new challenge.
    </p>

    <p>
        Competing collegiately taught me how important fundamentals are—proper grip,
        throwing mechanics, shot selection, and confidence on the putting green.
        Those skills don’t just help you score better; they make the game more fun.
    </p>

    <p>
        Inside the Circle is about helping others build confidence and consistency
        in their game. Whether you're brand new or looking to refine specific skills,
        personalized tutoring can help you improve faster and enjoy disc golf more.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="text-center mt-4">
    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"
       asp-controller="Home"
       asp-action="Calculator">
        Calculate Tutoring Cost
    </a>
</div>
